msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Tidetrace Isles\n"
"Language: en\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "旅行者 %d"
msgstr "Observer %d"

msgid "四枚同种动物过剩，已自动更换。"
msgstr "All four wildlife tokens matched and were replaced."

msgid "请在选取地块前使用。"
msgstr "Use this before drafting."

msgid "请选择至少一枚动物。"
msgstr "Select at least one animal."

msgid "无效的动物选择。"
msgstr "Invalid wildlife selection."

msgid "自然标记不足。"
msgstr "Not enough nature tokens."

msgid "每回合仅可免费更换一次三枚同种动物。"
msgstr "You may replace matching triples for free only once per turn."

msgid "请选择三枚同种动物。"
msgstr "Select the three matching animals."

msgid "请先完成当前回合。"
msgstr "Finish the current turn first."

msgid "请选择市场中的地块与动物。"
msgstr "Select a tile and an animal from the market."

msgid "跨组选取需要一枚自然标记。"
msgstr "Drafting across columns costs one nature token."

msgid "请先从市场选取。"
msgstr "Draft from the market first."

msgid "地块须与已有地块共边，且不能重叠。"
msgstr "Place the tile beside an existing tile in an empty space."

msgid "动物须放在有对应图标、且尚未入住的地块。"
msgstr "Choose an unoccupied tile marked with this species."

msgid "请先选取动物。"
msgstr "Select an animal first."

msgid "请摆放地块，并安置动物或选择放归。"
msgstr "Place the tile, then settle or release the animal."

msgid "未知的联机操作。"
msgstr "Unknown network action."

msgid "存档不兼容"
msgstr "Incompatible save"

msgid "巡护潮池"
msgstr "Patrolled tide pool"

msgid "掘穴守潮"
msgstr "Burrow at Low Tide"

msgid "每只招潮蟹得 2 分。脚下有泥滩就再加 1 分。"
msgstr "Each fiddler crab scores 2 points. Add 1 if its tile has mudflat."

msgid "泥滩多 1 分"
msgstr "Mudflat adds 1"

msgid "开口迎潮"
msgstr "Open Entrances"

msgid "每只招潮蟹先得 1 分。数它脚下地块周围的未铺空位。每两个空位加 1 分，剩一个也加 1 分。"
msgstr "Each fiddler crab starts with 1 point. Count the unbuilt spaces next to it. Add 1 per pair, and 1 more for any left over."

msgid "留出空位"
msgstr "Leave open space"

msgid "三角蟹阵"
msgstr "Triangle Burrows"

msgid "共边的招潮蟹算一群。每群只数一个最好的形状：单只、相邻两只、三只彼此相邻的小三角，分别得 {scores} 分。群里其余每只得 {extra} 分。"
msgstr "Score each connected group of crabs separately. Use its best shape once: a single crab, a touching pair, or three crabs all touching one another score {scores} points respectively. Each remaining crab in that group adds {extra}."

msgid "三只围成小三角"
msgstr "Form a triangle"

msgid "潮线采样"
msgstr "Tide-Line Survey"

msgid "每只招潮蟹得 1 分。挨在一起的招潮蟹算一群。只看群外地块朝向蟹群的那条边，每种地貌加 1 分。同一群里同种地貌只算一次，每只蟹最多给这群带来 2 分加分额度。"
msgstr "Score 1 point per fiddler crab. Crabs on touching tiles form a group. Look at the edges on outside tiles that face the group. Add 1 per different terrain along those edges, up to 2 extra points per crab in the group."

msgid "认蟹群外的边"
msgstr "Read outside edges"

msgid "岩面啃藻"
msgstr "Algae on Rock"

msgid "每只帽贝先得 1 分。脚下和周围紧挨着的地块里，每块只要有岩礁就加 1 分，最多加 2 分。"
msgstr "Each limpet starts with 1 point. Add 1 for each tile with reef under or next to it, up to 2 extra points."

msgid "找岩礁"
msgstr "Look for reef"

msgid "两岸消浪"
msgstr "Wave Shelter"

msgid "每只帽贝先得 2 分。沿穿过它的三条直线看，只要紧挨它、正对的两侧都有地块，就再加 1 分。"
msgstr "Each limpet scores 2. Add 1 once if there are tiles immediately on both sides of it along any straight line."

msgid "两侧正对都有地"
msgstr "Tiles on both sides"

msgid "归壳潮痕"
msgstr "Home Scar"

msgid "每只帽贝先得 1 分。数脚下地块和邻地相接的边，只有两边地貌相同才算。对上至少一处加 1 分，对上三处或更多再加 1 分。"
msgstr "Each limpet scores 1. Count the joins where its tile and the neighboring tile show the same terrain along the touching edges. Add 1 for at least one match, and 1 more for three or more matches."

msgid "相接边地貌相同"
msgstr "Match touching edges"

msgid "岩脊贝列"
msgstr "Ridge Lines"

msgid "共边的帽贝算一群。每群数最长的一条直线，中间不能断。线长 1 至 4 格分别得 {scores} 分，之后每多一格加 {step} 分。线外每只得 {extra} 分，同一群只算一条线。"
msgstr "In each connected group of limpets, score its longest unbroken straight line once. Lines of 1 to 4 score {scores} points. Each further limpet in the line adds {step}. Each limpet off the line adds {extra}."

msgid "连成直线"
msgstr "Build a straight line"

msgid "迎风起飞"
msgstr "Into the Wind"

msgid "每只燕鸥先得 1 分。绕着它数连续的未铺空位，看最长的一段。连续两个加 1 分，连续三个或更多加 2 分。"
msgstr "Each tern scores 1. Look for the longest run of unbuilt spaces immediately around it. Add 1 for a run of two or 2 for a run of at least three."

msgid "留两个连着的空位"
msgstr "Two open spaces in a row"

msgid "展翅分岔"
msgstr "Forked Wings"

msgid "每只燕鸥先得 1 分。沿着它的六条边看，若两个方向各有相邻地块，而且两方向之间刚好隔一条边，就组成一个叉口。每个叉口加 1 分，最多算两个。"
msgstr "Each tern starts with 1 point. Two neighboring tiles form a fork if their directions from the tern are 120 degrees apart. Each distinct fork adds 1, up to two forks."

msgid "向两侧展翅"
msgstr "Make a fork"

msgid "跳岛鸟群"
msgstr "Stepping-Stone Flocks"

msgid "两只燕鸥若在同一直线上，中间恰好隔一块已铺地，就能结伴。沿这些连接找到整群，每只只数一次。每群 1 至 4 只分别得 {scores} 分，之后每多一只加 {step} 分。"
msgstr "Two terns link if they lie on a straight line with exactly one placed tile between them. Follow these links to find each flock and count each bird once. Flocks of 1 to 4 score {scores} points. Each further bird adds {step}."

msgid "隔一格结伴"
msgstr "Link across one tile"

msgid "迁徙落脚点"
msgstr "Migration Stops"

msgid "每只燕鸥得 1 分。从燕鸥直着跨过一块地，第二格有砾滩或盐沼就加 1 分。全岛同一落脚格只算一次。全岛有几只燕鸥，最多就数它们两倍的落脚格。"
msgstr "Score 1 point per tern. Look straight across one placed tile. Add 1 if the second tile has shingle or salt marsh. Count each landing tile once across the island, up to two per tern."

msgid "跨地找落脚点"
msgstr "Fly to a landing tile"

msgid "湿泥换气"
msgstr "Breathing on the Flat"

msgid "每只弹涂鱼得 1 分。脚下有泥滩或潮池就加 2 分，即使两种都有也只加一次。"
msgstr "Each mudskipper scores 1 point. Add 2 if its tile has mudflat or tide pool, even if it has both."

msgid "住泥滩或潮池"
msgstr "Mudflat or tide pool"

msgid "跨滩换位"
msgstr "A Change of Ground"

msgid "每只弹涂鱼先得 2 分。只要旁边有一块地与脚下完全没有相同地貌，就再加 1 分。"
msgstr "Each mudskipper scores 2. Add 1 once if any neighboring tile shares no terrain with its own tile."

msgid "邻地地貌全不同"
msgstr "Neighbors with no match"

msgid "聚潮鱼群"
msgstr "Schooling Tide"

msgid "共边的弹涂鱼组成一群，可以拐弯或分叉。每群单独数，1 至 4 只分别得 {scores} 分，之后每多一只加 {step} 分。"
msgstr "Mudskippers on touching tiles form a school that can bend or branch. Score each school separately. Groups of 1 to 4 score {scores} points. Each further fish adds {step}."

msgid "鱼群连成片"
msgstr "Connect a school"

msgid "横穿潮沟"
msgstr "Across the Channel"

msgid "每只弹涂鱼先得 2 分。看穿过它的三条直线，两头紧挨的地块要一边有泥滩、另一边有潮池。第一条符合的线加 2 分，之后每条加 1 分。"
msgstr "Each mudskipper scores 2. Check the three lines through it for mudflat on one neighboring tile and tide pool on the opposite one. The first qualifying line adds 2 and each further line adds 1."

msgid "泥滩潮池正对"
msgstr "Mudflat opposite pool"

msgid "翻石觅食"
msgstr "Turning Stones"

msgid "每只水獭先得 1 分。看紧挨着它的地块，招潮蟹、帽贝、弹涂鱼每看见一种就加 1 分。同种来几只都只加 1 分。"
msgstr "Each otter starts with 1 point. Add 1 for each kind of prey on neighboring tiles: fiddler crab, limpet and mudskipper. Count each kind once."

msgid "找三种猎物"
msgstr "Look for three kinds of prey"

msgid "背风育幼湾"
msgstr "Sheltered Nursery"

msgid "每只水獭先得 1 分。绕着它看一圈，如果有三个连着的位置都铺了地块，就加 2 分。只加一次。"
msgstr "Each otter starts with 1 point. Look around it. If three consecutive spaces have tiles, add 2 points once."

msgid "三块地围一侧"
msgstr "Three tiles around one side"

msgid "结伴浮游"
msgstr "Rafting Pairs"

msgid "两只水獭共边，且都没有挨着第三只水獭，就算一对。全岛有 1 至 4 对分别得 {scores} 分，之后每多一对加 {step} 分。没配成对的水獭每只得 {extra} 分。"
msgstr "Two touching otters form a pair only if neither touches a third otter. Score all pairs together. For 1 to 4 pairs score {scores} points. Each further pair adds {step}. Each unpaired otter scores {extra}."

msgid "两两结对"
msgstr "Make separate pairs"

msgid "水域巡护"
msgstr "Pool Patrol"

msgid "每只水獭得 1 分。它脚下或旁边有潮池，就巡护整片。相接边都是潮池才连成一片。每片先加 1 分，再按地块每块加 1 分，最多数三块。几只水獭巡同一片只算一次。"
msgstr "Score 1 per otter. A tide pool on or beside it is patrolled. Matching pool edges join tiles into a pool. Each patrolled pool adds 1, plus 1 per tile up to three tiles. Count each pool once across all otters."

msgid "给连片潮池加分"
msgstr "Score connected pools"

msgid "招潮蟹"
msgstr "Fiddler crab"

msgid "帽贝"
msgstr "Limpet"

msgid "弹涂鱼"
msgstr "Mudskipper"

msgid "燕鸥"
msgstr "Tern"

msgid "水獭"
msgstr "Otter"

msgid "岩礁"
msgstr "Reef"

msgid "盐沼"
msgstr "Salt marsh"

msgid "砾滩"
msgstr "Shingle"

msgid "泥滩"
msgstr "Mudflat"

msgid "潮池"
msgstr "Tide pool"

msgid "联机协议版本不兼容。"
msgstr "Incompatible network protocol."

msgid "无效的联机命令。"
msgstr "Invalid network command."

msgid "无效的联机参数。"
msgstr "Invalid network arguments."

msgid "房主"
msgstr "Host"

msgid "只有未开始的房主可以开局。"
msgstr "Only the host can start a game, before play begins."

msgid "请等待所有玩家连接并准备。"
msgstr "Wait for all players to connect and ready up."

msgid "重连超时，联机房间已结束。"
msgstr "Reconnection timed out. The room has closed."

msgid "玩家重连超时，房间已结束。"
msgstr "A player could not reconnect in time. The room has closed."

msgid "还没轮到这位玩家。"
msgstr "It is another player's turn."

msgid "操作已处理，请勿重复发送。"
msgstr "This action has already been processed."

msgid "版本不同，请两位玩家使用同一份最新游戏包。"
msgstr "Version mismatch. All players need the same game version."

msgid "房间已开局，不能加入新玩家。"
msgstr "This game has started and is closed to new players."

msgid "房间已满，请选择其他房间。"
msgstr "The room is full. Choose another room."

msgid "旅行者"
msgstr "Observer"

msgid "连接失败。请检查房主热点 IPv4 地址、UDP 35721 防火墙放行及热点是否允许设备互访。"
msgstr "Connection failed. Check the host hotspot's IPv4 address, firewall access to UDP 35721, and whether the hotspot allows devices to communicate."

msgid "入住："
msgstr "Resident: "

msgid "可入住："
msgstr "Suitable for: "

msgid "选取一组"
msgstr "Choose a pair"

msgid "点击左侧金边的第 1 组。点地块或弹涂鱼都可以，两件会一起选中。"
msgstr "Click the gold-framed first column on the left. Clicking its tile or mudskipper selects both."

msgid "领取样区"
msgstr "Take your pair"

msgid "点击市集下方的「确认选取」，把这组地块和弹涂鱼领取样区。"
msgstr "Click “Confirm draft” below the market to collect the tile and mudskipper."

msgid "转一转地块"
msgstr "Rotate the tile"

msgid "按 E 或点击「E ↷」，把新地块的泥滩转向右下方，对齐起始地块的泥滩。"
msgstr "Press E or click “E ↷” to turn the new tile's mudflat toward the lower right, matching the starter mudflat."

msgid "接长泥滩"
msgstr "Extend the mudflat"

msgid "点击棋盘上的金色六角空位。同类生境接边，会连成更大的区域。"
msgstr "Click the gold hex space. Matching terrain along a shared edge forms a larger habitat."

msgid "安置弹涂鱼"
msgstr "Settle the mudskipper"

msgid "点击新地块上的白色圆圈。弹涂鱼只能住进带弹涂鱼图标、还没住动物的格子。"
msgstr "Click the white circle on the new tile. Mudskippers need an empty tile marked with their species."

msgid "完成回合"
msgstr "Finish turn"

msgid "看一眼版图上的试摆分数，再点击「完成回合」。确认前可以撤回摆放。"
msgstr "Check the score preview on the map, then click “Finish turn.” You can undo placements until you confirm."

msgid "练习完成"
msgstr "Practice complete"

msgid "首回合已经落定。点击「查看练习得分」，看看生境与动物分别怎样得分。"
msgstr "The first turn is complete. Click “Practice score” to see how habitats and wildlife scored."

msgid "选取一组地块与动物，开始构筑你的生态世界。"
msgstr "Draft a tile and an animal to begin your island."

msgid "潮 间 带 · 观 测 手 记"
msgstr "INTERTIDAL FIELD NOTES"

msgid "潮痕群岛"
msgstr "Tidetrace Isles"

msgid "退潮后，礁石与泥滩渐渐露出。\n沿着潮线，为五种动物留下栖身之处。"
msgstr "As the tide ebbs, reefs and mudflats emerge.\nFollow the shoreline and find a home for five species."

msgid "开始新的旅程"
msgstr "New expedition"

msgid "首回合练习"
msgstr "Practice first turn"

msgid "局域网联机"
msgstr "LAN multiplayer"

msgid "继续上次旅程"
msgstr "Continue expedition"

msgid "玩法说明"
msgstr "Field guide"

msgid "设置"
msgstr "Settings"

msgid "退出游戏"
msgstr "Quit game"

msgid "1–4 位旅行者   /   20 回合   /   离线游玩"
msgstr "1–4 observers   /   20 turns each   /   Offline play"

msgid "低潮调查 · 群岛生态记录"
msgstr "Low-tide survey · Island ecology"

msgid "已连接 %d / %d 位旅行者。"
msgstr "%d / %d observers connected."

msgid "加入  %s  ·  %s/%s"
msgstr "Join  %s  ·  %s/%s"

msgid "正在连接房间……"
msgstr "Connecting to room…"

msgid "已连接房主，等待开局。"
msgstr "Connected to host. Waiting for the game to start."

msgid "连接中断，正在尝试重连（最多 120 秒）。"
msgstr "Connection lost. Reconnecting for up to 120 seconds."

msgid "当前玩家断线，等待重连。"
msgstr "The active player disconnected. Waiting for reconnection."

msgid "正在连接……"
msgstr "Connecting…"

msgid "轮到 "
msgstr "Turn: "

msgid "请选择地块与动物。"
msgstr "Choose a tile and an animal."

msgid "正在摆放，可等待或查看其他版图。"
msgstr "Placing pieces. You can wait or explore other boards."

msgid "联机提示"
msgstr "Network notice"

msgid "重新连接"
msgstr "Reconnect"

msgid "练习旅行者"
msgstr "Practice observer"

msgid "无法读取存档"
msgstr "Could not load save"

msgid "存档无法读取。可以关闭此窗口并开始新的旅程。"
msgstr "The save could not be read. Close this window to start a new expedition."

msgid "旅程已恢复，继续上次的选择。"
msgstr "Expedition restored. Continue where you left off."

msgid "自动存档写入失败，请检查磁盘空间。"
msgstr "Autosave failed. Check available disk space."

msgid "旅程完成"
msgstr "Expedition complete"

msgid "回合完成"
msgstr "Turn complete"

msgid "动物已刷新"
msgstr "Wildlife refreshed"

msgid "选择完成后，点击「确认选取」。"
msgstr "When ready, click “Confirm draft.”"

msgid "试着旋转一次，看看地块的朝向怎样变化。"
msgstr "Try rotating once to see how the terrain edges move."

msgid "点击虚线空格放地块；也可先切换到「放动物」。"
msgstr "Click an outlined space to place the tile, or switch to “Place animal” first."

msgid "先转到泥滩对齐，再点击金色空位。"
msgstr "Rotate to align the mudflats, then click the gold space."

msgid "请点亮框标出的练习落点。"
msgstr "Click the highlighted practice space."

msgid "请先从左侧市集选取一组地块与动物。"
msgstr "Choose a tile and an animal from the market on the left."

msgid "点击带白圈的栖息地安置动物，也可选择放归。"
msgstr "Click a habitat with a white circle to settle the animal, or release it."

msgid "泥滩接上了！把弹涂鱼放到新地块上。"
msgstr "The mudflats connect! Place the mudskipper on the new tile."

msgid "地块与动物均可继续调整。满意后点击「完成回合」。"
msgstr "You can still adjust both pieces. Click “Finish turn” when ready."

msgid "动物已选择栖息地，接着摆放地块。"
msgstr "The animal has a home. Place the tile next."

msgid "弹涂鱼已安置。可以确认这一回合，也可以撤回重试。"
msgstr "Mudskipper settled. Confirm the turn or undo and try again."

msgid "请等待轮到自己且连接恢复后再操作。"
msgstr "Wait for your turn and an active connection."

msgid "正在同步操作……"
msgstr "Syncing action…"

msgid "，轮到你了。选择下一组地块与动物。"
msgstr ", your turn. Choose the next tile and animal."

msgid "这一回合已落定，练习数据不会保存。"
msgstr "Practice turn complete. Practice progress is not saved."

msgid "点击计分项目，可在版图上查看得分依据。"
msgstr "Click a score category to highlight its contributing tiles."

msgid "%s：%d 分。金色边框显示参与计分的地块。"
msgstr "%s: %d points. Gold borders mark the scoring tiles."

msgid "%s：最大相连区域 %d 分，奖励 %d 分。"
msgstr "%s: largest habitat %d points, bonus %d points."

msgid "重置图例"
msgstr "Reset example"

msgid "点击圆片移除，再点空格恢复，观察分数变化。共边才算相邻；图例只计算本张动物卡，不影响对局。"
msgstr "Click a token to remove it, then click the same space to restore it. Neighbors share an edge. The examples score only this card."

msgid "查看本项得分 · %d 分"
msgstr "Inspect score · %d pts"

msgid "潮间带调查手册"
msgstr "Intertidal Field Guide"

msgid "看图认识动物计分"
msgstr "Wildlife scoring examples"

msgid "试着在图例中移走一枚动物，再放回原处。上方按钮可翻阅本局采用的五张观察卡。"
msgstr "Remove a token from the example and put it back. The buttons above open the five cards used this game."

msgid "01  选一组，放两次"
msgstr "01  Draft two pieces"

msgid "从市集选一个编号组，一起取走岛块和动物。沿任意一条外缘扩建海岸。动物可以先安置，也可等新岛块落定后再安排。"
msgstr "Choose a numbered group from the market and take its tile and animal. Extend the island at any outer edge. You can settle the animal before or after placing the new tile."

msgid "02  为动物找到家"
msgstr "02  Find a home"

msgid "寻找印有该物种图案的空地块。每格只容纳一只动物。选择放归会将动物送回袋中。在只有一种图案的地块安置动物，可领取一枚自然标记。"
msgstr "Choose an empty tile showing the species. Each tile holds one animal. Release an animal to return it to the bag. Settling on a tile with just one species icon earns a nature token."

msgid "03  自然标记与动物过剩"
msgstr "03  Nature tokens and overpopulation"

msgid "选取前可以花一枚自然标记，从不同编号组搭配岛块和动物，或重抽指定的动物。仍有标记就能再次使用。市集中若出现三只同种动物，这回合可免费换掉这三只一次。四只同种会自动重抽。"
msgstr "Before drafting, spend a nature token to take a tile and an animal from different groups or replace selected animals. You may spend more tokens in the same turn. If three market animals match, you may replace all three once for free. Four matching animals are automatically replaced."

msgid "04  连接岛岸"
msgstr "04  Connect the shore"

msgid "转动岛块，让同色生境沿边相接。每种颜色只测量最大的一片，面积每格记一分。动物的得分条件请翻阅右侧观察卡。"
msgstr "Rotate tiles to join matching terrain along shared edges. Only the largest patch of each habitat scores, at one point per tile. Check the cards on the right for wildlife scores."

msgid "05  独行与同行"
msgstr "05  Solo and local play"

msgid "独自调查时，每次交接后两列剩余组件的末项各随潮水离开，新组件由上方补入。多人同行时只填空缺。每位调查员各记录二十回合。"
msgstr "In solo play, the bottommost remaining tile and the bottommost remaining animal wash away after each turn. New pieces enter from the top. In multiplayer, only empty slots refill. Each observer plays twenty turns."

msgid "06  终局计分"
msgstr "06  Final scoring"

msgid "将观察卡分数、生境面积、面积奖励及手中的自然标记相加。独自调查的七格生境奖两分。两人比较同色面积，领先者奖两分，持平各一分。三至四人按名次奖三分、一分；两人同居首位各两分，更多人同居首位各一分，并列第二没有奖励。总分持平先比标记数，再持平便共享胜利。"
msgstr "Add wildlife cards, habitat sizes, habitat bonuses and remaining nature tokens. In solo play a habitat of at least seven tiles earns two bonus points. With two players the leader for each habitat earns two points, or one each for a tie. With three or four players, first scores three and second one. Two tied leaders earn two each; three or more earn one each. Tied second earns nothing. Break overall ties by remaining tokens, then share the win."

msgid "操作与存档"
