msgid "相邻：两块地共用一条边。"
msgstr "Neighbors: tiles that share an edge."

msgid "相接的两条边：两块地碰在一起的那一对边。"
msgstr "Touching edges: the two edges where neighboring tiles meet."

msgid "正对的两侧：从动物往一边看一格，再往完全相反的方向看一格。"
msgstr "Opposite sides: the two spaces immediately across from each other, with the animal in the middle."

msgid "空地块：已经铺好、但没有动物。没铺地块的位置叫未铺空位。"
msgstr "Unoccupied tile: a placed tile with no animal. An unbuilt space has no tile at all."

msgid "地貌：地块上的地形。算同种地貌连片时，相接的两条边必须是同种地貌。"
msgstr "Terrain: the ground printed on a tile. Two tiles are part of the same habitat patch when their touching edges show the same terrain."

msgid "点击动物可以移走它，点原处放回。图里的分数只算这张卡。"
msgstr "Click an animal to remove it and click the same spot to put it back. The example scores only this card."

